<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Wednesday 108,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Wednesday 108,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wednesday's actual interior Iowa/southern Minnesota hog marketings were 108,000 head, compared with 100,000 estimated, USDA said.</p>
<p>Opening trade not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts were steady compared to the midsession Wednesday.</p>
<p>				   Country		   Plant</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    49.50 -50.50	   50.50 -51.50</p>
<p>few			49.00  51.00	   50.00  52.00</p>
<p>Sows: 500 dn steady-1.00 higher, 500 up steady-1.00 lower.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  40.00 -43.00	   42.00 -44.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   43.00 -45.00	   44.00 -45.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    48.00 -51.00	   50.00 -52.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
